.TH pvc-impulseresponse 1  "pvc-impulseresponse " 
.SH NAME
pvc\-impulseresponse \- Impulse\-response analysis: zero\-pads and FFTs a `[\-\-begin, \-\-end)` window of each input channel into a peak\-normalized `.ir` file (Phase 5\*(Aqs FFT\-convolution family \- see `pvc\-core::tools:: impulseresponse`\*(Aqs doc comment for what\*(Aqs out of scope)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpvc\-impulseresponse\fR [\fB\-\-begin\fR] [\fB\-\-end\fR] [\fB\-\-normalization\fR] [\fB\-\-normalization\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> <\fIOUTPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Impulse\-response analysis: zero\-pads and FFTs a `[\-\-begin, \-\-end)` window of each input channel into a peak\-normalized `.ir` file (Phase 5\*(Aqs FFT\-convolution family \- see `pvc\-core::tools:: impulseresponse`\*(Aqs doc comment for what\*(Aqs out of scope).
.PP
Ports `impulseresponse`\*(Aqs analysis path (`legacy/pvc_src/ impulseresponse.c`).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-begin\fR \fI<BEGIN>\fR [default: 0]
`\-b`: analysis window start, in seconds
.TP
\fB\-\-end\fR \fI<END>\fR [default: 0]
`\-e`: analysis window end, in seconds (`0` = end of file)
.TP
\fB\-\-normalization\fR \fI<NORMALIZATION>\fR [default: together]
`\-N`: how the per\-channel spectra are peak\-normalized
.TP
\fB\-\-normalization\-db\fR \fI<NORMALIZATION_DB>\fR [default: 0]
`\-d`: normalization target level, in dB
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>

.TP
<\fIOUTPUT\fR>

